message: >-
  If you use the cartridge concept, spec, runtime ABI, or task profiles
  in your research or implementation, please cite this repository.
title: >-
  SKaiNET-cartridge: Cartridge Specification, Runtime ABI, and Task Profiles
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Harakal
    given-names: Michal
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7981-4075
  - name: SKaiNET-developers contributors
    website: https://github.com/SKaiNET-developers
version: "0.4"
date-released: "2026-10-05"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/SKaiNET-developers/SKaiNET-cartridge
url: https://skainet-developers.github.io/SKaiNET-cartridge/
abstract: >-
  Specification of the cartridge: a self-contained, application-agnostic
  software package that runs one model on given hardware, with a minimal
  input-to-output API callable from any language. Covers the cartridge
  contract and descriptor, the C runtime ABI (v0.1), per-task consumer
  profiles, blueprints and materialization, and the integrity and
  licensing model.
# The repository is the specification itself; implementations are provided
# elsewhere. Citations should therefore point at the spec document, not at
# a software release.
